cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "systemc-signoff-evidence: review reports, measurement scripts and data for Proof Before Push"
authors:
  - family-names: Kubavat
    given-names: Mayur
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-1087-8558"
    affiliation: Independent Researcher
abstract: >-
  Independent review reports, measurement scripts and data behind the report
  Proof Before Push, which applies a sign-off checklist (fail-then-pass test,
  baseline regression, clean build, independent review) to 58 change branches
  in four open SystemC verification libraries: SystemC, UVM-SystemC, CRAVE and
  FC4SC.
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/mayurkubavat/systemc-signoff-evidence"
keywords:
  - SystemC
  - UVM-SystemC
  - verification
  - sign-off
  - regression
